          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7318' id='45' type-v2='text' w='94732' x='4697' y='9364'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#da2625' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='22'>Vendor Self Service Ratio - General</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Vendor self service ratio:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12'>Vendors requests which are created via vendor portal or self service actions divided by all vendors requests</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Average Total SS Percentage:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12'> Calculate the self service percentage for each plugin then divide it to number of plugin</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Weighted Average Total SS Percentage:</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='12'>Sum all self service action and then divide it to total service action count</run>
